# SPIDER's six tracks (18 Nov 2026): a project of the eight (SPIDER's before, or LOOM-SMK's; tests/fixtures/
# spider8_store.bin, made by tests/fixtures/make_spider8.xy with the eight-track build 8e67b07) loads with T7 and T8 left out: T1-T6
# as they were, the conductor and throws moved down two (their patterns, locks, scenes, WEAVE's bits), what pointed
# at T7 or T8 let go; saved, a six-track project that loads again the same
storeload tests/fixtures/spider8_store.bin
reboot
wait 400
expect note 2 1 1 40
expect note 6 1 2 48
expect trigs2.1 1
expect trigs6.1 1
expect trigs7.1 1
expect par6.level 77
expect par9.level 66
expect lane 2 1 cut 1
expect lanes 1
expect spat1.6 1
expect spat1.7 1
expect spat2.1 2
expect spat2.7 2
expect spat2.8 2
expect smute2 129
expect weave 1 1 0x41 4
expect weave 1 5 0x80 2
expect par7.e1 0
expect par7.e4 2
expect par3.lspeed 7
expect par4.lspeed 0
expect par5.lspeed 8
tap HOME
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 400
expect note 2 1 1 40
expect note 6 1 2 48
expect trigs7.1 1
expect smute2 129
expect weave 1 1 0x41 4
expect par7.e4 2
expect par3.lspeed 7
expect lanes 1
